@base_url = http://localhost:8080/api/listings

### happy path: create a need
POST  {{base_url}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "type": "NEED",
  "quantity": 10,
  "quantityRemaining": 10,
  "urgency": "HIGH",
  "neededBy": "2026-09-30",
  "status": "OPEN"
}

### Need2
POST  {{base_url}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "type": "NEED",
  "quantity": 10,
  "quantityRemaining": 10,
  "urgency": "MEDIUM",
  "neededBy": "2026-09-30",
  "status": "OPEN"
}

### Happy path: Create a SURPLUS
POST {{base_url}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "type": "SURPLUS",
  "quantity": 7,
  "quantityRemaining": 7,
  "availableUntil": "2026-10-10",
  "status": "OPEN"
}

### happy path: find by id
GET {{base_url}}/22 HTTP/1.1


### happy path: find by userId
GET {{base_url}}/myListings?userId=1


### happy path: update a listing
PUT {{base_url}}/8?requesterId=2 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 5,
  "type": "SURPLUS",
  "quantity": 10,
  "quantityRemaining": 10,
  "availableUntil": "2026-10-19",
  "status": "OPEN"
}


### delete
DELETE {{base_url}}/22?requesterId=2

